        "tag": "h3",
        "text": "Fast facts about selling your home"
      },
      {
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Cleanliness matters: A radiant, decluttered home can substantially boost your profit."
      },
      {
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Correct pricing is key: Homes rightly priced from the outset draw many buyers, ensuring they sell quickly."
      },
      {
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Selling is inconvenient: Anticipate disturbances to your typical week and devise strategies to tackle them for a seamless selling journey."
      },
      {
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Fix repairs early: Neglected repairs might make potential buyers exaggerate repair expenses and undervalue your cherished space."
      },
      {
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Overpricing aids competitors: Exorbitantly priced homes repel the right buyers, inadvertently promoting neighboring properties."
      },
      {
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Buyers negotiate post-inspection: Brace yourself for discussions over repair expenditures following inspections."
      },
      {
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Odor can impact pricing: Keep at bay persistent scents from pets or cooking that could discourage potential house hunters."
      },
      {
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Cash isn't always superior: A meticulously crafted offer from a financed buyer can challenge and even surpass a cash proposition."
      },
      {
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Maintenance pays off: Buyers willingly shell out more for homes that exude care and love over the years."
      },
      {
        "tag": "h3",
        "text": "About Sharon Hodnett"
      }
